    "Borrowed original mappings wait on existing HardwareWait release readiness without rescanning or duplicate subscription; cancellation retains no VM cycle",
    "Immediate explicit reclaim skips borrowed mappings without unused subscriptions; optional resident-limit policy reads the live shared mapped counter"
  ],
